message: "Attribution is not required (CC0), but if you cite this dataset please use the metadata below."
title: "Kosibah golden set: synthetic women for testing body-faithful image generation"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/dannybarnett/kosibah-golden-set-synthetic-women"
authors:
  - family-names: Barnett
    given-names: Danny
    email: danny@dannybarnett.com
  - name: "Kosibah Couture"
keywords:
  - virtual try-on
  - synthetic dataset
  - benchmark
  - skin tone
  - body shape
  - image generation
abstract: >-
  64 AI generated full body photographs of 23 invented women with known attributes
  (Monk skin tone, ancestry, hair, age, height, US dress size, body shape, distinct
  features, mobility aids), in clean reference conditions and in realistic bad
  conditions (mirror selfies, backlight, lamp light, clutter, crops, loose clothing).
  Built to measure whether image systems preserve a person's appearance. Includes
  persona cards, prompts, per-image provenance logs and the generator script.
